## Third-party components

This project deploys and extends two upstream open-source projects:

### SearXNG (AGPL-3.0)
This project uses the official `searxng/searxng` Docker image without modification.
The SearXNG source code is licensed under AGPL-3.0 and remains the property of
the SearXNG project. https://github.com/searxng/searxng

